<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διευκρῐν-έω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διευκρίνηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.47
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>:—<i>arrange carefully,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διηυκρινημένοι ὁπλῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					8.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>examine thoroughly, elucidate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.56.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος ποτέροις</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.28.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀπορούμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, cf. Phld.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ περί τινος λόγος -εῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.5.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Att.
			, only in 
				Med.
			, as <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prm.</u>
				135b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>judge rightly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ διαφέροντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					31.8.1
				</span></i>
			, al.</div>
